# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Restart the dev server after changing.
#
# ⚠  EVERYTHING HERE IS PUBLIC.
# Vite inlines any VITE_* variable into the JavaScript bundle at build time.
# Anyone can read these by viewing source. Only put values here that are
# *designed* to be public (a form endpoint URL, a provider's public access
# key). Never an API secret, a database URL, an SMTP password or a private key.


# ── Contact form ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where enquiries go. Without this the form falls back to opening the
# visitor's mail client — which silently loses every enquiry from someone
# without a configured mail app. Set one of these before launch.
#
#   sheets     Google Apps Script → Google Sheet.
#              Free, data stays in Futr's own Drive, no third-party vendor.
#              Setup instructions: scripts/google-apps-script.gs
#
#   formspree  Hosted form backend. Set ENDPOINT to your form URL.
#   web3forms  Hosted form backend. Set ACCESS_KEY instead of ENDPOINT.
#   endpoint   Any JSON API you control. POSTs the payload as-is.
#   none       (default) No backend — mailto fallback only.

# VITE_CONTACT_PROVIDER=sheets
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXX/exec

# For web3forms only:
# VITE_CONTACT_PROVIDER=web3forms
# VITE_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
